  "body": "A fresh new look, all the hard work done, and just in time for summer! If you've been looking to downsize without compromising on location, garaging, or lifestyle, this lovely single-level brick-and-tile home could be exactly what you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nThe current owners have gone to considerable effort to make this home move-in ready, with a complete repaint inside and out, including the roof. Brand-new vinyl flooring in the kitchen and bathrooms, new showers, vanities and tapware, new curtains and fresh carpet in the garage are just some of the improvements that mean you can simply move in, unpack and enjoy.\r\n\r\nSimple, sunny and beautifully refreshed, the home offers three bedrooms, including a primary suite with its own ensuite, plus a second bathroom. Light-filled living spaces open through ranch sliders to a private patio, while the lovely front garden provides a welcoming outlook and just enough outdoor space to enjoy without spending your weekends maintaining it.\r\n\r\nAnd there's plenty of practicality too. A double internal-access garage, additional parking for the boat or campervan and your own freehold title with no shared driveway make this an incredibly appealing option for those wanting to simplify life without giving up the things they love.\r\n\r\nBut one of the real highlights is the setting. Bordering the northern boundary of the property is a walkway connecting you to the beautiful Mangrove Lake Walk, which also links through to the estuary walkway. Imagine stepping outside each morning and enjoying a peaceful stroll alongside the water, surrounded by nature and birdlife. What a wonderful way to start or finish the day! You could even explore adding your own gate for more convenient access, subject to any necessary approvals.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the convenience of Lakeside Drive. Orewa College, Orewa Intermediate and the local kindergarten are all around 500 metres away, with Victor Eaves Park less than 500 metres from home. Just under a kilometre takes you into Orewa Village, where cafés, restaurants, shops and everyday amenities are waiting, while the beautiful sands of Orewa Beach are never far away.\r\n\r\nSingle-level, freehold, brick and tile, with all the recent improvements already taken care of. This really is quintessential easy-care Orewa living.\r\n\r\nThe property is vacant, meaning being settled and enjoying your first Christmas and summer here could be a very real possibility.\r\n\r\nMove in, put your feet up and enjoy everything Orewa has to offer!\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser : https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/JZFY",
